{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/44f7ba30295ea2eca9adcd41b4a9a538.avif?t=1772991032\" width=784 height=236 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/37fee37f6b66ea8c7696cd06dd0b9fd7.avif?t=1772991032\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On entering your local Starlight megastore in the hope of getting a midnight snack, a horrifying star-shaped parasite suddenly attacks you, replacing your head with... <strong>itself.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can even calm down, you look back and realize <strong>the entrance has vanished. </strong><br>You are not alone in here, and the exit has yet to be found. Investigate alone or with up to <strong>8 friends</strong> as you explore, collect, build, and survive against the monstrosities roaming this ever-changing dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.poster.avif?t=1772991032\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.webm?t=1772991032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.mp4?t=1772991032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/cb705a58d15e96570c075f65f708b5ca.avif?t=1772991032\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When lights are on, the store seems suspiciously calm... make the most of it by gathering a wide variety of atypical store provisions to survive starvation until you escape and stock up on any other useful resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the store closes, the monstrous employees clock in. <strong>The night shift begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you let hunger consume you before the monsters do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.poster.avif?t=1772991032\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.webm?t=1772991032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.mp4?t=1772991032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/4cd649f7fc59fdd1be4421509c802bae.avif?t=1772991032\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself from various abominations by<strong>\u00a0</strong>setting up fortifications before nightfall.\u00a0<br><strong>Build a base to your taste using the physics based construction system and its dynamic environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.poster.avif?t=1772991032\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.webm?t=1772991032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.mp4?t=1772991032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/cb404b16aef114d701223bb18e769711.avif?t=1772991032\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, a blood moon rises\u2026 <strong>it's time to run to the pharmacy</strong>, the only safe place in this store where a handful of employees have managed to keep their humanity, all thanks to the pharmacist. Beneath her eccentric personality hides a complete genius in dozens of fields: medicine crafting, robotics, interdimensional studies\u2026 <br>You are now an employee of Starlight, Inc! Fulfill missions from the remaining staff, buy upgrades from the pharmacist and most importantly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>find a way out of this never-ending liminal torment.</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.po